---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What EV Trip Reports collects and how it is used.">
  <section class="band band--tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1 class="h1">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:20px">Draft, last updated October 14, 2026. Pending legal review.</p>

      <h2>Reading the guides</h2>
      <p>You can read every guide without an account. We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits. It doesn't set cookies or track you across other sites.</p>

      <h2>Requesting a plan</h2>
      <p>When you request a plan, we collect what you put in the form: your name, email, car, charge port and adapter, route, dates, passengers, memberships, and notes. We use it to build your plan, email you about it, and ask for a trip report afterward. It's stored with our hosting provider, Cloudflare.</p>
      <p>AI tools help research and draft plans, so your trip details may be processed by an AI provider for that purpose. We don't use your details for anything else.</p>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don't sell or rent your information.</li>
        <li>We don't share it with charging networks, hotels, or advertisers.</li>
        <li>We don't add you to the newsletter unless you ask.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>Ask us to delete your request and its details at any time by replying to any email from us. We delete plan requests one year after the trip date unless you ask us to keep them.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top will change with it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
